  description: 'Cyberse Link Monsters you control cannot be destroyed by your opponent''s
    card effects. Once per turn, during the Battle Step, if your monster battles
    an opponent''s monster: You can activate this effect; that opponent''s monster''s
    ATK becomes 0 until the end of this turn, also for that battle, monsters cannot
    be destroyed by battle and neither player takes battle damage. That opponent''s
    monster must be face-up on the field to activate and to resolve this effect.
    When your opponent activates a card or effect during a Damage Step that your
    "Code Talker" monster is attacking in: You can banish this card from your GY;
    negate the activation, and if you do, your attacking monster gains 700 ATK.'
